              "value": "Claws And Jaws"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Frequency: 1/round\n\nMembers of the cavalry leap from their mounts and attack each enemy within 10 feet (DC 41 basic Reflex save). The damage depends on the number of actions.\n\n- **1A:** 2d12+14 piercing and slashing plus 1d12 void\n- **2A:** 3d12+14 piercing and slashing plus 1d12 void\n- **3A:** 4d12+14 piercing and slashing plus 1d12 void"
